        "exit_code": 0,
        "stdout": "usage: story.py [-h] [--version]\n                {template,init,status,migrate,audit,world-save,world-check,world-read,cache-get,cache-put,history-deps,history-inspect,history-publish,history-refresh,history-snapshot,history-start,history-state,history-update,export,notes,plan,context,prepare,reconcile,recall,chapter-read,dependencies,sources,lint,commit,adopt,ingest,coverage,next,record,findings,source-read,report}\n                ...\n\nStory Skill: local, bounded context and transactional writing state. No API\ncalls.\n\npositional arguments:\n  {template,init,status,migrate,audit,world-save,world-check,world-read,cache-get,cache-put,history-deps,history-inspect,history-publish,history-refresh,history-snapshot,history-start,history-state,history-update,export,notes,plan,context,prepare,reconcile,recall,chapter-read,dependencies,sources,lint,commit,adopt,ingest,coverage,next,record,findings,source-read,report}\n    template            Print just one JSON input example\n    init                Create state once; never overwrite an existing book\n    status              Compact checkpoint and export health\n    migrate             Explicit schema upgrade with a consistent rollback\n                        backup\n    audit               Hash every managed export and report conflicts\n    world-save          Save structured story state with cited evidence\n    world-check         Check recorded rules, knowledge and continuity\n    world-read          Inspect one stored narrative record, including stale\n                        evidence for reviewed repair\n    cache-get           Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    cache-put           Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-deps        Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-inspect     Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-publish     Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-refresh     Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-snapshot    Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-start       Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-state       Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-update      Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    export              Repair exports without replacing outside edits\n    notes               Save cards or a chapter plan with optimistic\n                        concurrency\n    plan                Save cards or a chapter plan with optimistic\n                        concurrency\n    context             Build a bounded chapter context packet\n    prepare             Read-only review scaffold bound to the current book,\n                        state and draft\n    reconcile           Inspect an outside edit of the latest native chapter,\n                        or apply its reviewed draft\n    recall              Bounded literal substring search of cards, summaries\n                        and chapter prose\n    chapter-read        Read a bounded excerpt of a current or immutable\n                        historical chapter\n    dependencies        Resolve candidate evidence hashes for a reviewed\n                        chapter dependency declaration\n    sources             Find saved source IDs and analysis checkpoints after a\n                        new session\n    lint  